degreePolynomial -- computes the degree polynomial of a poset
*************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        z = degreePolynomial P
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 
  * Outputs:
      * z, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the degree
        polynomial of $P$

Description
===========

The degree polynomial of $P$ is the sum over elements $v$ of
$x^{\operatorname{in}(v)} y^{\operatorname{out}(v)}$, when the exponents are
the incoming and outgoing valences of $v$ in the Hasse diagram.

This polynomial is multiplicative for Cartesian product of posets.

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : B = booleanLattice 3;        |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : z = factor degreePolynomial B|
|                                  |
|            3                     |
|o2 = (x + y)                      |
|                                  |
|o2 : Expression of class Product  |
+----------------------------------+

