fPolynomial -- computes the f-polynomial of a poset
***************************************************

  * Usage: 
        f = fPolynomial P
        f = fPolynomial(P, VariableName => symbol)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 
