isAtomic -- determines if a lattice is atomic
*********************************************

  * Usage: 
        i = isAtomic P
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, a lattice
  * Outputs:
      * i, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether $P$ is atomic

Description
===========

The lattice $P$ is atomic if every non-minimal vertex of $P$ is the join of
atoms of $P$.  Equivalently, $P$ is atomic if every non-minimal, non-atom
vertex of $P$ covers at least two vertices.

The diamond poset is atomic.  Also $n$ *note booleanLattice: booleanLattice,s
are atomic.

+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = poset {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {1, 4}, {2, 5}, {3, 5}, {4, 5}};|
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : isLattice P                                                |
|                                                                |
|o2 = true                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isAtomic P                                                 |
|                                                                |
|o3 = true                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isAtomic booleanLattice 4                                  |
|                                                                |
|o4 = true                                                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------+

The following lattice is non-atomic.  Also, $n$ *note chain: chain,s are
non-atomic, for $n \geq 3$.

+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : Q = poset {{1, 2}, {1, 3}, {2, 4}, {2, 5}, {3, 4}, {4, 6}, {5, 6}};|
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : isLattice Q                                                        |
|                                                                        |
|o6 = true                                                               |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isAtomic Q                                                         |
|                                                                        |
|o7 = false                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : isAtomic chain 5                                                   |
|                                                                        |
|o8 = false                                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note atoms: atoms, -- computes the list of elements covering the minimal
    elements of a poset
  * *note isLattice: isLattice, -- determines if a poset is a lattice

Ways to use isAtomic:
=====================

  * "isAtomic(Poset)"

