isomorphism(Poset,Poset) -- computes an isomorphism between isomorphic posets
*****************************************************************************

  * Function: *note isomorphism: (Isomorphism)isomorphism,
  * Usage: 
        pi' = isomorphism(P, Q)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 
      * Q, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
