isStrictSperner -- determines if a ranked poset has the strict Sperner property
*******************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        i = isStrictSperner P
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, a ranked poset
  * Outputs:
      * i, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether $P$ is strict
        Sperner

Description
===========

The ranked poset $P$ is strict Sperner if the *note maximalAntichains:
maximalAntichains, are the sets of elements with the same rank.

The $n$ *note chain: chain, is strict Sperner as the maximal antichains and the
sets of elements with the same rank are singletons.

+----------------------------+
|i1 : isStrictSperner chain 5|
|                            |
|o1 = true                   |
+----------------------------+

The $n$ *note booleanLattice: booleanLattice,, for $n \geq 3$, is not strict
Sperner as it has maximal antichains which are not sets of elements with the
same rank.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : B = booleanLattice 3;                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : isStrictSperner B                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : rankPoset B                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {{000}, {001, 010, 100}, {011, 101, 110}, {111}}                        |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : maximalAntichains B                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = {{000}, {111}, {001, 110}, {010, 101}, {011, 100}, {001, 010, 100},     |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {011, 101, 110}}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

