openInterval -- computes the subposet contained strictly between two points
***************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        I = openInterval(P, a, b)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 
      * a, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, an element of the poset
