elements $z$ such that $p < z < q$.  If $a$ and $b$ are incomparable, then an
error is thrown.

+----------------------------------+
|i1 : P = booleanLattice 3;        |
+----------------------------------+
|i2 : openInterval(P, "001", "111")|
|                                  |
|o2 = Relation Matrix: | 1 0 |     |
|                      | 0 1 |     |
|                                  |
|o2 : Poset                        |
+----------------------------------+

