plueckerPoset -- computes a poset associated to the Plücker relations
*********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        P = plueckerPoset n
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the size of the set to
        partition
  * Outputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: Poset,, 

Description
===========

The ideal of Plücker relations has a quadratic Groebner basis.  Under a
suitable term order, the incomparable pairs of the poset $P$ generate the
initial ideal of the ideal of Plücker relations.

Given two subsets $S$ and $T$ of ${0,\ldots,n-1}$, we partially order $S \leq
T$ if $\#S \geq \#T$ and $S_i \leq T_i$ for all $i$ from $1$ to $\#T$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = plueckerPoset 4;                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : coveringRelations P                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {{{0}, {1}}, {{1}, {2}}, {{0, 1}, {0, 2}}, {{2}, {3}}, {{0, 2}, {0, 3}},|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {{0, 2}, {1, 2}}, {{1, 2}, {1, 3}}, {{0, 1, 2}, {0, 1, 3}}, {{3}, {}},  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {{0, 3}, {0}}, {{0, 3}, {1, 3}}, {{1, 3}, {2, 3}}, {{1, 3}, {1}}, {{0,  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     1, 3}, {0, 2, 3}}, {{0, 1, 3}, {0, 1}}, {{2, 3}, {2}}, {{0, 2, 3}, {0,  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     2}}, {{0, 2, 3}, {1, 2, 3}}, {{1, 2, 3}, {1, 2}}, {{0, 1, 2, 3}, {0, 1, |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     2}}}                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

