Poset -- a class for partially ordered sets (posets)
****************************************************

Description
===========

This class is a type of *note HashTable: (Macaulay2Doc)HashTable, which
represents finite posets.  It consists of a ground set, a list of relationships
$\{a,b\}$ where $a \leq b$, and a matrix encoding these relations.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = {1,2,3,4};                  -- the ground set                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R = {{1,2},{1,3},{2,4},{3,4}};  -- a list of cover relations            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : P = poset(G, R)                 -- the poset with its relations matrix  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = P                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Poset                                                                   |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|computed                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

